Title: What is the best way to keep receive items in the subscriber after the error
Description: I have a PublishSubject which triggers simultaneous downloading operations. The results of that operations are zipped and handled with a single subscription. I want to know what is the best approach to keep receive all future events from the publish subject after the error occurs in one of the downloading process (without try/catch). I've implemented the test case to demonstrate the behaviour. It works as expected but doesn't look very elegant.

```
@Test public void testOnErrorResumeNext() {
    PublishSubject<Boolean> mBooleanPublishSubject = PublishSubject.create();
    mBooleanPublishSubject.asObservable()
            .doOnNext(__ -> System.out.println("mBooleanPublishSubject: on value emitted " + System.currentTimeMillis()))
            .flatMap(b -> Observable
                    .defer(() -> Observable
                            .zip(
                                    Observable
                                            .just(b)
                                            .map(__ -> 1),
                                    Observable
                                            .just(b)
                                            .flatMap(__ -> {
                                                if (Math.random() > 0.8) {
                                                    System.out.println("Generate error");
                                                    throw new RuntimeException("test");
                                                } else {
                                                    return Observable.just(2);
                                                }
                                            })
                                    , (integer, integer2) -> integer + integer2))
                    .onErrorResumeNext(t -> {
                        System.out.println("onErrorResumeNext" + t.getMessage());
                        return Observable.empty();
                    }))
            .doOnNext(__ -> System.out.println("zip value emitted " + System.currentTimeMillis()))
            .doOnCompleted(() -> System.out.println("zip value completed " + System.currentTimeMillis()))
            .doOnError(t -> System.out.println("zip value error " + System.currentTimeMillis()))

            .subscribe(v -> System.out.println("done " + v + " " + System.currentTimeMillis()));

    mBooleanPublishSubject.onNext(true);
    mBooleanPublishSubject.onNext(true);
    mBooleanPublishSubject.onNext(true);
    mBooleanPublishSubject.onNext(true);
    mBooleanPublishSubject.onNext(true);
    mBooleanPublishSubject.onNext(true);
    mBooleanPublishSubject.onNext(true);
}
